{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0364_1000_p", "source_sha256": "1ebe4d1a2083a5d5be2f1a074e3142cb5d163a5397c7f8d8b38cfbd27d8e1f63", "ja": "（今日は原宿で亜利沙と昴のPV撮影だ。予定通りに\n進行し、休憩に入った。様子を見に行ってみるか……）", "zh": "（今天是在原宿拍摄亜利沙和昴的PV。拍摄按计划进行，现在进入休息时间了。去看看她们的情况吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0364_1001_028ari", "source_sha256": "8753c3f505193c02225cd17fd1146c2a2c1774779128224db0dc258329accb2e", "ja": "あ、あの、{$P$}さん！\nなんだか、すごい見られてる気がするんですが……。", "zh": "那、那个，{$P$}先生！\n总觉得，好像有很多人在盯着我看……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0364_1002_syugaku1", "source_sha256": "9d3d133f7993fc2404a138a884209e984e76a8b94cdd20c6c659b833a5217ee7", "ja": "わあ～。なんの撮影してるんだろう？\n……見てみて！　あの子、カワイイ～！", "zh": "哇～。是在拍什么呢？\n……快看快看！那个女孩子，好可爱～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0364_1003_syugaku2", "source_sha256": "2bdc3ec762ef28ba4124cd449eb69ba7f292a5158cc054f5f7c8c8f263c84a98", "ja": "あっ。テレビで見たことある！\n765プロのアイドルだよ！　名前は……。", "zh": "啊。我在电视上见过！\n是765事务所得偶像！名字是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0364_1004_028ari", "source_sha256": "1737da5f5e613482313e3fa06f88640dcf1b75a0187cc512c06dae849620cbf5", "ja": "わわっ！　携帯で写真まで撮られちゃってます……！\nな、なんでありさの写真なんか……。", "zh": "哇哇！居然还用手机拍了照片……！\n为、为什么要拍亚利沙的照片……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0364_1005_p", "source_sha256": "bc53f2c58980950337e92ec5aef7ac1239202b45199846f7e7bb657df58ac55f", "ja": "そんなに驚かなくても。\n亜利沙が可愛いから撮ってるんじゃないかな。", "zh": "不用这么惊讶吧。\n应该是因为亚利沙很可爱，所以才拍的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0364_1006_028ari", "source_sha256": "eb7f52ec38ccfe9a91eef3ca7e150622c5750aa9b87e35cb33b85a08277fc4be", "ja": "カ、カワイイだなんて、そんなことは！\nきっとアレです！　撮影に遭遇した記念でパシャっと。", "zh": "说、说什么可爱啊，才没有这回事！\n肯定是那个！为了纪念偶遇拍摄现场，咔嚓拍一张。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0364_1007_p", "source_sha256": "b2b4d4df67c5e4f95ce60a3effe06b06544ad9312238e1ab2928123c453953d3", "ja": "ああ……それはあるかもしれないな。\nまあ、亜利沙は自然にしていればいいよ。", "zh": "啊……也许确实有这个可能。\n不过，亜利沙你只要保持自然就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0364_1008_028ari", "source_sha256": "c4947913f9c75e3de3c9dfb13d52287b0d85b519dc9c366129f4167a4ba32aa0", "ja": "し、自然にと言われましても……。\nさすがにここまで注目されてしまうと……。", "zh": "可、可是您说要自然一点……这都被关注到这种程度了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0364_1009_028ari", "source_sha256": "0a33ce4539bca560a5e36861f29ba6f64ae347db6059d3421f3b8fec98e6a6b2", "ja": "自然とは？　ありさ、いつもどうしてたっけ？\nううっ。意識すればするほど、緊張してきました～！", "zh": "自然是指什么？亜利沙平时是怎么做来着？\n呜呜，越是刻意去想，就越紧张起来了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0364_1010_p", "source_sha256": "6eff5d3566cc6f8bf748c9a5ca91b8a76c97761ff30665ab207b14109763a831", "ja": "（かなり動揺してるみたいだな。どうにかして\n落ち着かせないと、撮影にも影響がでそうだ……）", "zh": "（看来她相当慌乱啊。要是不想办法让她冷静下来，恐怕会影响拍摄……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0364_1011_p", "source_sha256": "1203eea881955a409a31d87345209f81cca52b3108278361755f39685975806e", "ja": "亜利沙も、街でアイドルを見かけたことはあるだろ？\n印象に残ってる人とかいるのか？", "zh": "亚利沙，你也在街上见过偶像吧？有没有谁给你留下了特别深的印象？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0364_1012_028ari", "source_sha256": "4ebd0ae9b7e74ee99a5d7447db3b8a0651be039ddf6d916d051bc809c61e490b", "ja": "もちろんです！　みなさん神対応ですけど、\n神を通り越して鬼対応してくれた方がいて……。", "zh": "当然有啦！大家的服务态度都堪称神对应，\n但有一位简直超越了神，完全是魔鬼对应……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0364_1013_028ari", "source_sha256": "69e5fbbcb4346602fea9578e00cec01c016511bfbadc31999f5e2883919c4781", "ja": "ありさは、遠くから撮影を眺めてて。\nそしたら、休憩中のアイドルちゃんがやってきて……。", "zh": "亚利沙在远处看着拍摄。\n然后，正在休息的偶像就走了过来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0364_1014_028ari", "source_sha256": "f07a144cc67c6bbb1946ab070bd867ea319db543065d3b3366944180990e7d50", "ja": "あっ、そうか。今が……。\n{$P$}さん、ありさ行ってきます！", "zh": "啊，对了。现在正是……  \n{$P$}先生，亚利沙这就去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0364_1015_p", "source_sha256": "b5f3850b6cd491b01b849760cefd98f881c6e24c0e948a920d708f9f3f933e70", "ja": "行ってくるって、どこにだ？　おい、亜利沙ー！", "zh": "说去去，去哪儿啊？喂，亚利沙——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0364_1016_syugaku2", "source_sha256": "7c9aa93fe4a562be972d44ff1d87c3d3991bcc0a9b3410c12a81ccb59c439855", "ja": "あれ？　亜利沙ちゃん、こっちに来てない？", "zh": "咦？亚利沙没有来这边吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0364_1017_syugaku1", "source_sha256": "0cd74d45c3180ba6bd2abcad506efc32fea18b32e0aa0121ece8bd2f1ffc6973", "ja": "えっ？　ウソウソー！　なんで～！？", "zh": "诶？骗人骗人——！为什么～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0364_1018_028ari", "source_sha256": "1ec73a94c60b6d38cc5f50180ea774f1f3abdc9adcc1a9d79dba6ad086accaca", "ja": "……コホン。みなさ～ん、お騒がせしておりますっ！\n765プロ所属の松田亜利沙ですっ！", "zh": "……咳咳。各位～打扰大家啦！\n我是隶属于765事务所的松田亚利沙！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0364_1019_028ari", "source_sha256": "7ee4272fea7532d925bcaf157bcd83d21499a09e1ed30f5a77aa7495a7307e82", "ja": "ええと、こんなにたくさんの人がいるところでの撮影は\n不慣れなんですけど……。その……。", "zh": "那个，这么多人在场的地方拍摄，我还不太习惯……那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0364_1020_028ari", "source_sha256": "e22c49b9f888a6da237bb880371502cdbc99d29b4a26b02822f525fe4e4c9f94", "ja": "もしよかったら、\nありさの撮影、見学していってくださいっ！", "zh": "如果不介意的话，请留下来参观一下亚利沙的拍摄吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0364_1021_syugaku1", "source_sha256": "1b8cdc8eb1b6e91ba1c5e5efa1c3e27dc8bbe68c0c3ae23576ef6be8bc648f6f", "ja": "わー。本物だ……。\nあ、あの！　サインとかもらってもいいですか？", "zh": "哇，是真的……。\n那、那个！可以请您签个名什么的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0364_1022_syugaku2", "source_sha256": "a89a1046b13ffc1f5697b27cea55fd8deda9bcacbd5a114b0ecbbcd6d922d4eb", "ja": "私も私も！\n亜利沙ちゃん、一緒に写真撮ってもらえませんか？", "zh": "我也是我也是！亚利沙，能请你和我一起拍张照片吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0364_1023_028ari", "source_sha256": "5e8ec9d936e0fc0e3537db5a33270a7cecd89b58cd8c2c8910ca34cca8fb6781", "ja": "はい、もちろんです！　……なんだか照れますね。\nでは先にサインから。おふたりは、学生さんですか？", "zh": "好的，当然可以！……总觉得有点害羞呢。\n那就先从签名开始吧。两位是学生吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0364_1024_p", "source_sha256": "20e30a634fbfa186cf23bda87a3738f62b5a473c7f568a59825cf9d152d69fd2", "ja": "（亜利沙のおかげで、撮影はいい雰囲気のまま進んだ。\n見学の人達にも、いい思い出になったみたいだな！）", "zh": "（多亏亜利沙，拍摄一直在愉快的氛围中进行。\n看来对前来参观的人们来说，也成了一段美好的回忆！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
